<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.50-2.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.50-2.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-2.00 higher. Trading moderately active. Top $59.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   59.00-59.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   57.50-58.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   55.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   54.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-500 lbs very uneven mostly steady to weak, 500-650 lbs steady to 0.50 lower. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs   47.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs   47.50-49.50</p>
</text>
